// Coin currency - PER-PLAYER wallet (CharacterStats.Coins, see CharacterStats.qtn), not a shared
// Frame.Global total. A pickup credits every connected player the same base amount, each scaled
// by their own CharacterStats.CoinGainMultiplier (see CoinUtility.Grant/GrantAll,
// CurrencyOrbSystem) - each player then spends their own balance independently. A second,
// independent currency from Rift Shards - see docs/global-upgrades.md "Economy" and
// docs/breathing-poi.md.
